    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A colorful code-guessing puzzle game where you must decipher the correct combination of gumballs to solve the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step up to the gumball machine and test your logic skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this color based guessing game your goal is to crack the code of the gumballs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll make guesses and receive hints to help you along getting the right combination, with each guess getting closes to the winning combination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing to casually unwind, challenge yourself to a new difficulty, or beat your best solve, this game will deliver a sweet satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crack the code and get popping!</p>",
